he crystal puller"},"do":[{"p":"pullerOutline","v":"show","w":"This"}],"shots":[{"hero":true,"focus":["puller","pullerOutline","pit"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"name2","shows":{"p":"wafers","does":"thin discs pop in as a stack of wafers"},"do":[{"p":"pullerOutline","v":"hide"},{"p":"wafers","v":"show","w":"Slice"},{"p":"wafers","v":"slice","w":"wafer"}],"shots":[{"focus":["wafers","pit"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"how","shows":{"p":"wafers","does":"a printer machine fires a light beam onto the wafer"},"do":[{"p":"wafers","v":"machine","w":"Machines"},{"p":"wafers","v":"print","w":"light"}],"shots":[{"focus":["wafers","pit"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fact","shows":{"p":"chips","does":"switch counter climbs to 20 billion"},"do":[{"p":"chips","v":"show","w":"chip"},{"p":"chips","v":"count","w":"20","d":2}],"shots":[{"focus":["wafers","chips","pit"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem2","shows":{"p":"dust","does":"dust lumps fall onto the wafer and stay"},"state":{"text":"DEAD CHIP","w":"dust"},"do":[{"p":"dust","v":"fall","w":"dust"}],"shots":[{"focus":["wafers","dust","pit"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem3","shows":{"p":"dust2","does":"wind and rain blow mud into the open hall"},"state":{"text":"BATCH RUINED","w":"mud"},"do":[{"p":"light","v":"storm","w":"wind"},{"p":"rain","v":"start","w":"rain"},{"p":"dust2","v":"fall","w":"mud"}],"shots":[{"focus":["puller","wafers","dust2","pit"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fix5","shows":{"p":"roof","does":"posts grow and a roof goes on, clean air flows down"},"do":[{"p":"rain","v":"stop","w":"roof"},{"p":"light","v":"clear","w":"roof"},{"p":"dust","v":"hide","w":"roof"},{"p":"dust2","v":"hide","w":"roof"},{"p":"roof","v":"build","w":"roof"},{"p":"airArrows","v":"show","w":"air"}],"shots":[{"focus":["roof","pit"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"finish","shows":{"p":"lamp1","does":"ceiling lights and stepping stones appear, pit runs clear"},"do":[{"p":"pineNews","v":"show"},{"p":"pineNews","v":"hide","w":"Add"},{"p":"airArrows","v":"hide","w":"Add"},{"p":"meter","v":"hide","w":"Add"},{"p":"temp","v":"hide","w":"Add"},{"p":"chips","v":"hide","w":"Add"},{"p":"lamp1","v":"show","w":"ceiling"},{"p":"lamp2","v":"show","w":"ceiling","o":0.15},{"p":"stones","v":"show","w":"stones"},{"p":"pit","v":"clear","w":"clear","o":-0.7}],"shots":[{"focus":["pit","lamp1","lamp2","stones"],"width":0.85}]},{"s":"congrats","do":[],"shots":[{"focus":"home"}]}],"roles":["hook","problem","stakes","fix1","fix2","fix3","fix4","name","name2","how","fact","problem2","problem3","fix5","finish","congrats"]},"sentences":[{"role":"hook","text":"If you dig a pit and let muddy water settle, you have a sandy floor."},{"role":"problem","text":"But sand is silicon locked to oxygen, so no current passes through it."},{"role":"stakes","text":"It is full of clay and iron, yet a chip allows only one foreign atom per billion."},{"role":"fix1","text":"So you pour the sand into a furnace with carbon."},{"role":"fix2","text":"So you heat it up to about 2,000 °C, and the oxygen burns off as gas."},{"role":"fix3","text":"But now that gas escapes, so you pipe it into a second tank where pure silicon forms."},{"role":"fix4","text":"So you melt the pure silicon and pull one single crystal out of it."},{"role":"name","text":"This is a Czochralski crystal puller."},{"role":"name2","text":"Slice the crystal into thin discs, and each disc is a wafer."},{"role":"how","text":"Machines print layer after layer of tiny switches onto each wafer with light."},{"role":"fact","text":"One modern chip can hold over 20 billion of those switches."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But a single speck of dust landing on a wafer can kill the chip."},{"role":"problem3","text":"In an open hall, wind and rain blow in mud and ruin a whole batch."},{"role":"fix5","text":"So you build a roof over the hall and push filtered air down, making a cleanroom."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add ceiling lights and stepping stones, and the pit runs clear."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a semiconductor factory."}]}